// The server (the repository root) and the library (garmin-connect/) are
// separate modules. This workspace builds the server against the library in
// this repository rather than the version its go.mod requires, so changes to
// both can be made and tested together. `go install …@version` and anyone
// importing the modules ignore it.
go 1.27.0

use (
	.
	./garmin-connect
)

// The go command still reads the go.mod of the library version the server
// requires. This points that version at the library here, so the workspace
// also builds before it is tagged. Keep the version in step with go.mod.
replace github.com/dianabarsan/garmin-training/garmin-connect v0.1.0 => ./garmin-connect
